{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trolling Bowling is a cross between a realistic physics driven bowling game, and everything you were told to never do at a bowling alley. Bowl as normal, but hit the golden rings to earn trolling points.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/cropped-CroppedScreenShot1.png?t=1740806236\" />Trolling Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your troll points to buy troll powers that hinder your opponents. Use a fog machine to blind them, cover the lane in landmines, or cover their ball in glue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/cropped-Screenshot_2025-01-07_153200.png?t=1740806236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Specialized Bowling Balls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your troll points to purchase upgraded balls that help you counter the troll powers your opponents use on you. Did they turn your pins to concrete? Turn your ball into a grenade and blow right through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/cropped-Screenshot_2025-01-07_153300.png?t=1740806236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic pro-level lane oil patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice mode to hone your skills countering troll powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic bowling mode without troll powers or unrealistic balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer matches with up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different whacky character models to choose from</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3175180?t=1740806236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3175180?t=1740806236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/50bb9b95f8dac5d48bb1e95b2f905edb70fc9410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740806236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/50bb9b95f8dac5d48bb1e95b2f905edb70fc9410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740806236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3518020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trolling Bowling is a cross between a realistic physics driven bowling game, and everything you were told to never do at a bowling alley. Bowl as normal, but hit the golden rings to earn trolling points.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/cropped-CroppedScreenShot1.png?t=1740806236\" />Trolling Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your troll points to buy troll powers that hinder your opponents. Use a fog machine to blind them, cover the lane in landmines, or cover their ball in glue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/cropped-Screenshot_2025-01-07_153200.png?t=1740806236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Specialized Bowling Balls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your troll points to purchase upgraded balls that help you counter the troll powers your opponents use on you. Did they turn your pins to concrete? Turn your ball into a grenade and blow right through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/cropped-Screenshot_2025-01-07_153300.png?t=1740806236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic pro-level lane oil patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice mode to hone your skills countering troll powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic bowling mode without troll powers or unrealistic balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer matches with up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different whacky character models to choose from</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Travis Soules"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/header.jpg?t=1740806236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101823,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101823/movie480.mp4?t=1740413395","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101823/movie_max.mp4?t=1740413395"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101823/d8bc81d2f7cf46530c52975fdaa4ea6f50835d5c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740413395","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101823/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740413395","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101823/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740413395"}}],"name":"Trolling Bowling","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4150 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 660 / AMD HD 7870 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</s